    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '- New: Fabricate the entire damaged blade from a block material using
    CNC

    - New: Fabricate the entire damaged blade from powder material using
    Laser Metal Deposition (LMD) and then use CNC for surface finish

    - Repair:
    Remove some layer from damaged area and form flat interface using CNC, then add
    materials using additive and finally use CNC for surface finish.

    - Repair:
    Remove some layers from damaged area and form finger joint interface using CNC,
    then add materials using additive and finally use CNC for surface finish.

    -
    Repair: Remove some layer from damaged area and form scallop joint interface
    using CNC, then add materials using additive and finally use CNC for surface
    finish

'
